<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Nahum chekhai, now arui khin dow 663-654 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Asuria pren kowi kowh Ninevi marowchakuüa vüi risi Nahum ruiah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi Asuria mih chenchap kür, nowng chang powng changra kiang hai bawrira prakowi towk kür khai. Naiawng rakowi Asuria kowi aia bekah angak khai. Ninevi marow piak mih hownia lusa kowi kowh maru maten nataripla kownkow natasang kown takla. Israeluüa chang ngak rakowi naripah kownkow Asuriauüa kowi Thurai tawngah mih chowdiah. Tawkche Asuriauüa mih amatni kowh nowng changra nadowi mih prakowi tawngah khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa nakaah kown mih ripra amatni kak taing iawng uang chowng khai. Asuria vüi kowi kowh Nahum peah mih ripra satang dow aia maru-uüa kowi sakklamra hai süngürra peah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jona hownia a-i tuk mih dow Ninevi marowchakuüa tarip mih hai amatni kowi Thurai ripah rowi dowi mih lawnguan chekhai. Now Nahum hownia a-i tuk mih dow Ninevi marowchakuüa amatni kowh tiama prim kowi plan mih hai amatni kowi Thurai ripah mih lawnguan chekhai. Thurai luk kowi pachowng mih maru chün lai khai pache nami iawng uang mih chowng kowh maru paw chün lai tangtang kown mih sakowmra amiapaw nowngia pe dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Nineviuüa luk kowi Thurai kunmarau mih 1:1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Nineviuüa piak mih 2:1-3:19</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NAM 1" />
  <para style="s">Ninevi marow luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kunmarau mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 1:1" />Mami dow Ninevi marow lawnguan kowi kowh Thurai laiklow chekhai. Mami bowih kowi arui uowi mih dow Elkaws kuachak risi Nahum khi mukmang mih lawnguan chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 1:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow <char style="w">khowrbown dawma</char> mih Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:2">aia dow chang ngak miuüa kowi sat pe klai reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:2">Aia kowi kowh kingküa miuüa kowi aia dow ripah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:2">aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi aia dow sat pe klai reng.<verse eid="NAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 1:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow kunmarau naklak dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:3">tawkche aia dow lowra nowng chang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:3">now maru ngakuüa kowi dow ripah dowi matchang aia lawtah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">Aia kowh nowng changra natüng kownkow aia dow liku hai uangchak uang pe uangah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:3">now uangnim dow aia khawkpha kowi kowh dinchow iawng chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 1:4" />Aw tui nakang kownkow aia peah ana hanow aw tui dow kang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:4">sata tui kowi paw nakang kownkow aia peah ana hanow kang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:4">Basan süng hai Karmel hungh kowi kowh pram asingma mih paw aia pe keuah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:4">now Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh pau maten paw aia pe ngawiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 1:5" />Aia pur kowi dow aiuk aiukma mih hungh paw chür reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:5">achah achachow mih hungh ün paw chawr reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:5">Aia pur kowi dow lusa hai alak kowi kowh uowi mih maten chür reng chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 1:6" />Aia kunmarau now aia pur kowi dow miapaw nowng uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:6">kramra uowima mih aia kowh kunmaraura dow miapaw nowng kham dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:6">Aia kowh kunmaraura dow maih iawng lün pluplup chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:6">aia pur kowi dow aiuk aiukma mih hua khowm tadila iawm khai.<verse eid="NAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 1:7" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiungma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:7">aia dow akrat pusa khin khe akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:7">Aia tut-e tatung tanim miuüa kowi aia dow mingkhetah reng chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 1:8" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow aia napiakta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:8">amatni kowi dow tuikling mangma hown asaima aia napiakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:8">Aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow makownguüa uowi rah kowi aia nasaah kown.<verse eid="NAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 1:9" />Aw Ninevi maru-uüa, tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kowi enni tuk kingküa khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:9">Aia dow akatchow sang napiakta enni bowk kown.<verse eid="NAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 1:10" />Enni dow chuh mung kowi kowh tatawm iawng natatawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:10">arak pua iawng enni nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:10">now chathang kam iawng alenma enni napiak kown.<verse eid="NAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 1:11" />Enni pungmadawng hownia maru uang lawt lowk ia khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:11">aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nakingküala kownkow krawi pe prengia ngak khai.<verse eid="NAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 1:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Judauüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:12">Asuriauüa dow akürma hai maru iun akawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:12">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow ang nasaita bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:12">Ang towk enni kawmkrat nowm chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:12">Nachenganchepaw kawmat hownia dow ang natowk enni kawmkrat kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="NAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 1:13" />Kawmat dow enni pangkawt kowi kowh kowbüah bat enni mih namuai ang nauowtta enni bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:13">now kowbüah tawmla enni mih leng ang naraita enni bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 1:14" />Aw Asuria mang, en lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:14">“En kowh ming natown en kownkow en krungchak hownia miapaw nauowi kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:14">en kowh thuraiuüa kim kowi kowh arup aren uowi mih maten ang napiakta en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:14">En dow maru ngak chekhai rakowi ang kamrütta en tadupra hüah khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="NAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 1:15" />Pai iow sam mü madiah, hungh luk kowi satang iung phowng mih uang khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:15">aia dow taking tasangra laiklow uang pawla khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:15">Judauüa low, enni kowh pawi sun büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:15">now enni takhamta mih iawng chang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:15">Maru ngakuüa mih nauang sen en kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 1:15">amatni kowi dow asaima napiakta bowt kown.<verse eid="NAM 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NAM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ninevi marow piak kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 2:1" />Aw Ninevi, nauang sen en kownkow ransu-uüa uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:1">Naiawng rakowi nadowk tasen kownkow kamrüt diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:1">En kowh siphai hawmh kowi kuaah lawmah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:1">kangchawngra kimkrowng akhawtma mih kowi tow siphai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:1">now tiama lengkawng kowi ün tow kangchawng mih diah.<verse eid="NAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 2:2" />Israeluüa kowh pren dow maru akhaw aklaima ransu-uüa changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:2">amatni kowh grep krum dow ransu-uüa piakta pe nak khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:2">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow alai kowh kraingra Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG napeah iawk kown.<verse eid="NAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 2:3" />Aw Ninevi, en kowh ransu siphaiuüa dow nauang dowk tasen kownkow kamrüt thüm khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:3">amatni dow aringma mih kawngma dowkla se uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:3">Amatni dow tawnguat aringma kangowh uang khupla khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:3">amatni kowh kawrnga kari kowi kowh lawngha dow tawk pluplup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:3">now amatni dow ui reh prungrung khai bowt.<verse eid="NAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 2:4" />Amatni kowh kawrnga kari dow marow kowi uang kup khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:4">amatni dow tiama towng kowi krawi lünla prung khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:4">Amatni kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng dow maitawng iawng tawkla plup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:4">amatni dow aiowm len krang pla nowi khe kowh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 2:5" />Nakhowk khe enni kowh mang dow aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi hawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:5">now aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa dow sakkrowng lai kowh takhum taphet prang uang iowm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:5">Amatni dow marow tap prakowi kowiowm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:5">now marow tap khue müa uanh kowpawla büah khai.<verse eid="NAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 2:6" />Nachenganchepaw aw pang kowi kowh tapplawt ün dow ransu-uüa khueta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:6">amatni dow naiawngün hownia uang kup hanow uang piak mang kim khai bowt.<verse eid="NAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 2:7" />Masiuüa mang kowi dow klüpta pe tawnguat khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:7">aia kowi dow khümla now pawla khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:7">Aia kowh narmauüa dow kaurawng uatur iawng ngukla run khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:7">amatni dow sak kowi rau lai kowh ti downgprang durlur khai.<verse eid="NAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 2:8" />Ninevi marow dow akhuema kowh tui hawr iualua mih kanh iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:8">aia kowh maru iukuüa dow, “Iowng diah, iowng diah,” pahai krawi town maru khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:8">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh maru-uüa dow miapaw kung pra ngeu dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 2:9" />Amatni kowh ransu-uüa tatek mih, “Kuh hai tai paw büah, paw büah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:9">Asung khakma mih uanh uowi bümma lowmow, paw büah, paw büah,” pakhai.<verse eid="NAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 2:10" />Ninevi marow kowi kowh dawngthawnguan maten dow ransu-uüa pawta bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:10">nami marow dow piakta nak hanow akhaw aklaima towla hüah khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:10">Aia maru-uüa kowh dow sak nen bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:10">amatni kowh dow kungh chürla kluk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:10">Amatni kowh dow kow kür uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:10">amatni dow kram lai bowt kowh müakangma phaw bowk khowk.<verse eid="NAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 2:11" />Naiawng phaw kung kowi dow maru nata tek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:11">“Krangsi khawng iawng thaulangma mih uowi rah marow kawmat tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:11">Nakowi dow amatni kowh chu chauüa kowi thaulangma peah chakkham reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:11">now nakowi mih krangsi iawng masiuüa, kachakuüa hai amatni kowh chauüa thaulangma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 2:12" />Ninevi mang dow achauüa chak müa alawkma krawi mak chak reng mih krangsi iawng chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:12">aia dow krangsima vüi ahuma krawi mak chak reng mih krangsila iawng chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:12">now aia dow krawi mak chak hanow aia uowi rah kuam kowi tow chak mih krangsi iawng chowdiah,” napa kown.<verse eid="NAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 2:13" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:13">“Aw Ninevi marow, ang mih en kowh ransu chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:13">en kowh kawrnga kari ün ang natowkta en bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:13">now en kowh akürma mih klanguüa hawmh kowi tasenra kowi ang nasaita kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:13">Mami lusa kowi mia kowi paw en nanowng kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 2:13">now en kowh satang phowng miuüa akeng chenchapuüa kowi tasen lawng hown krawi ia krawk kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="NAM 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NAM 3" />
  <para style="s">Ninevi marow kowi naripah kown mih satang</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 3:1" />Krawi sai maru reng mih Ninevi marow luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Ninevi dow limma dawma mih marow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:1">Nami marow kowi dow krawi limmaah mih hai kür hown krawi rupah mih uanh atekma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:1">nakowi dow maru sak sai mih katpaw taing dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 3:2" />Nakowi dow ransu-uüa krawi bawp maru mih klow hai kawrnga kari khawk tün ta khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:2">nakowi dow kawrnga chet klow hai kawrnga kari lün klow paw ta khai.<verse eid="NAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 3:3" />Kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa dow krawi sai maru khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:3">saidawng hai reh dow tawkla plup khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">Ka arau miuüa hai uak tachun mih sam mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:3">kowng mih hu lai bowt kowh uak kowi maru tatheu prang towbowt.<verse eid="NAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 3:4" />Naiawng Ninevi marow phaw mih dow chawkkrawma iawng mih lup chang rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:4">aia dow maru na-irah kownkow tawngkeng maiaklese khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:4">Aia dow aia kowh maiaklese hown chenchapuüa kowi kuanah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:4">now aia kowh maiaklese powingia hown maru-uüa kowi towah nar khai.<verse eid="NAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 3:5" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Ninevi, ang mih en kowh ransu chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:5">en kowh uanklai mih ngawng mowr ang nalowtta en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">En kowh tengiow tengklaira dow chenchapuüa kowi ang natüng pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:5">now en kowh rukraira dow pren towng kowi ang natüng pe kown.<verse eid="NAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 3:6" />En luk kowi dow ang nakuak en mawngchawng kuaisek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:6">en kowi dow suiiai kaniaima ang namü en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:6">now maru prawngren müa ang nachangla en kown.<verse eid="NAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 3:7" />Nakhowk khe dow en kowi mih miapaw namü en kown nanau kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:7">Maru natek en kown mih, ‘Ninevi marow piak tüng khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:7">Mia iawng mih chow aia vüi nakar nanguk kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:7">Nadep narua en kown mih maru tawng kowi chow ang nacham ka en kown?’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="NAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 3:8" />Aw Ninevi, Thebes marow lak-e en lang iung khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:8">Thebes marow dow Nail aw ria kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:8">Nami marow kowi dow tui umta lut khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:8">naiawngün tui dow aia kowh taka müa tap iawng chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 3:9" />Ethiawpia pren hai Aigupta pren dow aia kowi khowngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:9">aia kowh auiua dow Put pren hai Libia pren chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 3:10" />Nachenganchepaw Thebes marowchakuüa kowi dow khümla now akeng prenchakuüa pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:10">now aia kowh ngeuüa hawmh kowi dow tiakrum kowi ransu-uüa saiah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:10">Ransu-uüa dow maru iukuüa kowi nachangla nar kownkow taretah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:10">now amatni kowi dow lawngha leng hown tawmla now ransu-uüa pawla khai.<verse eid="NAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 3:11" />Aw Ninevi, en paw pua mih iawng natim bawilawi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:11">ransu-uüa hownia naplaila kownkow en nacham tapet kown.<verse eid="NAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 3:12" />En kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow uidut uih min khe kowh uidut singh iawng naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:12">nami dow kowhowng uidut singh khe kowh ahowng miuüa nawr kowi uidut uih dowh mih iawng naown kown.<verse eid="NAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 3:13" />En kowh siphaiuüa maten dow masiuüa hawmh iawng kür uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:13">en pren kowi kowh tapplawt maten dow ransu-uüa pur kowi auowma kangowh khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:13">Naiawngün tapplawt klia dow maih kamta bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 3:14" />Ransu-uüa uang rum en khe kowh vüi towngta tui mowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:14">en kowh kangchawngra kimkrowng akhawtma changah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:14">Nek suplawk hanow thawp ipbawn diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:14">se hai thundi ün lawkah hanow ipbawn hown thawp tap diah.<verse eid="NAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 3:15" />Nachenganchepaw maih mih nakamta en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:15">now saidawng mih nasowita en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:15">Krawi piak kheti mih plawng hawm iawng asaima ransu-uüa napiak en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:15">Naiawng rakowi tuiselengkeng nammow hai plawng hawmh iawng enni prung chepaw enni naplai kown nadowi.<verse eid="NAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NAM 3:16" />En kowh kun chang mih maru iun dow kuang kowi kowh krek lak-e hu en pe prungah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:16">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow chala uanh bowk now powt mih plawng hawmh iawng amatni powtta en khai.<verse eid="NAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NAM 3:17" />Plawng hawmh dow chungrau khin khe tap kowi mownla rim khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:17">Nachenganchepaw sat uang lawt khowk now tawng pra ngai chow cham iow mih tukah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:17">En kowh kangchawng miuüa dow plawng hawmh iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:17">now en kowh maru iukuüa paw plawng hawmh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NAM 3:18" />Aw Asuria mang, en kowh aluchowuüa dow müi thüm chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:18">en kowh maru iukuüa dow mawkla phu chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:18">En kowh maru-uüa dow hungh towng mawng towng cham tauet plawt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:18">amatni kowi nakrawi kuaah lawmah kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="NAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NAM 3:19" />En kowh arau dow tawng iawng mih chap hown paw ia iung dowi bowt tak.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh ma dow lainowmma hu khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:19">En kowh nowng chang powng changra hownia dow miapaw plai dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NAM 3:19">Naiawng rakowi en piak mih satang ta miuüa maten dow awmrawm kowh phek rut khai.<verse eid="NAM 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 3" />
</usx>